Description: The envirotox R data package provides Species Sensitivity
    Distribution (SSD) datasets from the Envirotox database 2.0.0 (Connors
    et al. 2019). The datasets are provided for assessing general patterns
    in SSD data and testing code. The datasets should not be used to draw
    any conclusions about the toxicity of the individual chemicals.
